meta {
  name: 05 Devices After Registration
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/devices
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  `GET /devices` again.

  **Expect:** three devices now — edge 3 self-registered using its TPM
  identity (watch its first logs arrive in the stream tab). Re-send until it
  shows up; the orchestrator registers within its polling interval
  (~a minute). If it takes longer, ask the demo operator to restart the
  orchestrator on that edge.

  The new device's `id` should match the `demoDeviceId` environment variable
  (3 for a fresh run) — the remaining steps target it.
}
